  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
        <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:tallith/mah_yakar">
          <tei:p>How precious is thy kindness, O God! The children of men take refuge in the shadow of thy wings. They have their fill of the choice food of thy house, and thou givest them drink of thy stream of delights. For with thee is the fountain of life; by thy light do we see light. Continue thy kindness to those who know thee, and thy righteousness to the upright in heart.</tei:p>
